---
title: Implemented cooked level loading and activation
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Generated page adapter
    participant R as Rust Assets and Loader
    participant I as JS I/O worker
    participant H as Native verified asset source
    participant T as Rust fixed tick
    Note over B,T: A stale or failed required result keeps the active room.<br/>Optional art failure retains primitive rendering.
    B->>R: Request supported level slot
    R-->>B: Required asset and generation
    B->>I: read asset and request ID
    I->>H: Bounded same-origin GET
    H-->>I: Approved cooked bytes
    I-->>B: asset-result with owned buffer
    B->>R: Upload bytes and generation
    R->>R: Verify digest and format
    R->>R: Prepare newest candidate
    T->>R: Commit at activation boundary
    R->>R: Seal replay and replace Room
    R-->>B: Publish incoming epoch at tick zero
